[agent] But actually, looking at the Hopsworks feature store, when you insert data into a feature group, it appends to the offline store. The online store is materialized from the offline store. So if I insert all batches, the offline store will have duplicates, and the online store will also have duplicates.
[agent] I need to deduplicate before inserting. Since I can't do it locally, I need to use the platform's capabilities. Let me check if there's a way to do this with the CLI.
[agent] Actually, re-reading the restrictions: "Basic shell — inspect the task (`cat`, `head`, `ls`, `grep`, `wc`, the `Read` tool on `data/`) and small bookkeeping (`mkdir`, `cp`)."
